{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And now your two sons, etc.</b> Meaning: now that I have seen that I have had no further sons from the side of that blessing, I know in retrospect that your two sons who were born to you, etc. — they are mine, for HaShem said to me, ״מַפְרְךָ וְהִרְבִּיתִיךָ״ (I will make you fruitful and multiply you), and this is what HaShem said to him at Beit El (Genesis 35:11): ״פְּרֵה וּרְבֵה״ — they shall be to me as Reuben and Shimon. And see what I have written nearby:"], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:49:50.619093772Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}